Additional note on the bundled Player2 Client ID (not a restriction on what
you can do with the code -- fork it, modify it, remove features, whatever
you want; this is just an explanation of one specific value):

launcher/providers/player2_auth.py includes a Player2 "Game Client ID"
(019fcd6c-41b2-7a18-ad57-3aa38f0b843e) registered on the Player2 Developer
Dashboard specifically for the official Palversation distribution.

If you redistribute a modified build that still uses Player2 as a
provider, please register your own Client ID instead of reusing this one.
This isn't enforced by this license (a copyright license isn't really the
right tool for that) -- it's a request backed by how Player2's own
platform works: every connection made through a given Client ID is
attributed to whichever app registered it, so reusing this one would
misattribute your users' connections to this project instead of yours.
Player2's own developer terms govern that ID, separately from this
license.
